{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And if it is an unclean animal, and redeem it at your valuation.</b> The firstborn along with the addition of a fifth, because he dedicated it; and he shall also give a lamb, for thus is written: if he does not dedicate it, and it is sold. And the exemption of a donkey. At the valuation he shall also give the lamb, and many say: not so."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:59.748554171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}